{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify frontend and Liquid developer. Build a fully responsive custom section that replicates the layout, colors, spacing, and content of the provided reference "image_c58f25.png".
    
    ### 1. Global Integration, Max Width & Basic Styles
    - **Theme Consistency:** The section must automatically inherit the current theme's typography family variables (e.g., `var(--font-heading-family)`, `var(--font-body-family)`), standard section maximum layout width (e.g., matching `.page-width` or `.container` wrappers), and default responsive side padding.
    - **Section Background:** Clean white background (#FFFFFF) or ultra-light gray tint with comfortable top/bottom padding.
    - **Main Box Container:** Wrap the entire content section in a large, horizontally centered card banner. 
      - Background: A very soft off-white or soft gray background tint.
      - Border: A thin, solid border featuring a muted light-olive green color tint.
      - Shape: Smooth rounded corners (border-radius: 16px).
      - Spacing: Generous internal padding layout to separate the chat bubble elements cleanly from the outer border.
    
    ### 2. Chat Bubble List Layout (Modular Blocks)
    The rows inside the main card container must stack vertically with a comfortable gap (approx. 12px to 14px) separating each row. Each chat item must be built as a repeatable block using a Liquid `{% for block in section.blocks %}` loop so more chat strings can be added or updated via the Shopify Customizer.
    
    Each individual row uses a dynamic layout structure:
    - **Left Column Asset (Avatar Box):** A small circular avatar container (~36px width). It should support an image picker (or fallback to an icon graphic) representing different user profile silhouettes.
    - **Right Column Content (Bubble Container):** A horizontally stretching bubble container pill.
      - Background: A slightly dark, desaturated off-white/gray tone to give contrast from the parent box.
      - Border Radius: Highly pill-shaped rounded corners (border-radius: 24px).
      - Alignment: Flex items row layout displaying the inline metadata label alongside the string.
    
    ### 3. Exact Text Content Map for 100% Replication
    Ensure the default section layout or blocks feature the exact Japanese text extracted from image_c58f25.png:
    
    #### Row Block 1:
    - **Avatar Graphic:** Male profile image
    - **Label Tag:** [状況] (Styled in a bright olive/lime green text font color)
    - **Message Content:** 「今日、何を優先すべきですか？」 (Dark navy/black text color)
    
    #### Row Block 2:
    - **Avatar Graphic:** Outline user profile line icon
    - **Label Tag:** [理由] (Styled in a bright olive/lime green text font color)
    - **Message Content:** 「なぜ購買率が下がっていますか？」 (Dark navy/black text color)
    
    #### Row Block 3:
    - **Avatar Graphic:** Female profile image
    - **Label Tag:** [次の打ち手] (Styled in a bright olive/lime green text font color)
    - **Message Content:** 「次に何を確認すべきですか？」 (Dark navy/black text color)
    
    ### 4. Shopify Coding & Theme Schema Requirements
    - All strings, color variables, block avatars, and tags must be mapped to fields in the Liquid schema (`"type": "text"`, `"type": "image_picker"`, etc.) to stay completely editable in the theme editor window.
    - Use explicit CSS Flexbox utilities (`display: flex; align-items: center;`) to make sure avatars map properly beside the message bubbles.
    - Wrap all CSS selectors directly into a style sheet scoped strictly to the section ID (`#shopify-section-{{ section.id }}`) to maintain code modularity without layout bleed across other pages.
    - Handle responsiveness cleanly: Ensure text drops down safely without spilling outside the horizontal bounds of the message pills on narrow mobile viewpoints.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-chat-bubble-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-chat-bubble-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--spacing-6, 24px);
  }

  .ai-chat-bubble-main-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.box_background }};
    border: {{ block.settings.box_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.box_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.box_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.box_padding }}px;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_content_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-chat-bubble-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.row_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-chat-bubble-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.avatar_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-chat-bubble-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: {{ block.settings.avatar_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.avatar_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.avatar_fallback_bg }};
  }

  .ai-chat-bubble-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-chat-bubble-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    color: {{ block.settings.avatar_fallback_color }};
  }

  .ai-chat-bubble-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-grow: 1;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.bubble_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.bubble_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.bubble_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.bubble_padding_horizontal }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.bubble_content_gap }}px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-chat-bubble-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.label_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.label_font_weight }};
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-chat-bubble-message-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.message_color }};
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.message_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.message_font_weight }};
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-chat-bubble-main-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.box_padding | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-chat-bubble-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.avatar_size | times: 0.85 }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.avatar_size | times: 0.85 }}px;
    }

    .ai-chat-bubble-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.bubble_padding_vertical | times: 0.85 }}px {{ block.settings.bubble_padding_horizontal | times: 0.85 }}px;
    }

    .ai-chat-bubble-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.label_font_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-chat-bubble-message-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.message_font_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<chat-bubble-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-chat-bubble-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-chat-bubble-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-chat-bubble-main-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-chat-bubble-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-chat-bubble-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-chat-bubble-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.avatar_1 %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.avatar_1 | image_url: width: 100 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.avatar_1.alt | escape }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="100"
                height="100"
              >
            {% else %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
                <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
              </svg>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="ai-chat-bubble-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.label_1 != blank %}
              <span class="ai-chat-bubble-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.label_1 }}</span>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.message_1 != blank %}
              <span class="ai-chat-bubble-message-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.message_1 }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-chat-bubble-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-chat-bubble-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.avatar_2 %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.avatar_2 | image_url: width: 100 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.avatar_2.alt | escape }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="100"
                height="100"
              >
            {% else %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
                <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
              </svg>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="ai-chat-bubble-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.label_2 != blank %}
              <span class="ai-chat-bubble-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.label_2 }}</span>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.message_2 != blank %}
              <span class="ai-chat-bubble-message-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.message_2 }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-chat-bubble-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-chat-bubble-avatar-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.avatar_3 %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.avatar_3 | image_url: width: 100 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.avatar_3.alt | escape }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="100"
                height="100"
              >
            {% else %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
                <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
              </svg>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="ai-chat-bubble-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.label_3 != blank %}
              <span class="ai-chat-bubble-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.label_3 }}</span>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.message_3 != blank %}
              <span class="ai-chat-bubble-message-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.message_3 }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</chat-bubble-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class ChatBubbleSection{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
      }
    }

    customElements.define('chat-bubble-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}', ChatBubbleSection{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

